  "description": "Governed erasure for dotnetcqrs, opt-in: a request to erase a data subject is held while a retention duty or a legal hold stands, and approved once none does. A business-owned retention policy, and a governor that drives each request to a conclusion. Builds on the core dataSubject aggregate in DotnetCqrs.Crypto and only adds refusals to it.",
